01:00:28.887 --> 01:00:30.204
You can pay your bills.

01:00:30.204 --> 01:00:31.037
- That's the best thing,

01:00:31.037 --> 01:00:33.036
you can pay your bills at-
- The convenience store, yeah.

01:00:33.036 --> 01:00:34.493
- That's wild to me.
- It's insane.

01:00:34.493 --> 01:00:36.372
