01:00:37.205 --> 01:00:39.140
It was a novelty at first.

01:00:39.140 --> 01:00:42.324
- 'Cause I think the best
and worst part of Japan to me

01:00:42.324 --> 01:00:43.810
is that it's like a dichotomy,

01:00:43.810 --> 01:00:46.188
it either works exceedingly well,

01:00:46.188 --> 01:00:47.989
it's well exceedingly optimized,

01:00:47.989 --> 01:00:51.806
or it's just 100 processes
to do the simplest shit.

01:00:51.806 --> 01:00:53.995
There's no middle ground.

01:00:53.995 --> 01:00:55.615
Nothing here works okay.

01:00:55.615 --> 01:00:57.446
It either works exceedingly well

01:00:57.446 --> 01:00:59.187
or it just doesn't work at all.

01:00:59.187 --> 01:01:03.257
